19. Final Engineering Directive
This document is the V1.0 release-completeness scope lock.
Implementation work under RC.1–RC.7 must remain bounded by the requirements defined here.
The purpose of this phase is to finish the product around the existing cinema experience — not to expand the product's feature surface.
Once RC.7 is accepted:
STOP ADDING FEATURES.

The next engineering objective is production readiness and release.
The target is not an endlessly expanding REELHOUSE.
The target is:
A polished, reliable, personal digital cinema that is ready to ship.

End of Specification